              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "कराना (karānā) is the causative partner of karnā, \"to do\": CDIAL lists Hindi karānā, \"to cause to be made\", under Sanskrit karṓti, \"does\" (CDIAL 2814). Someone else does the work for you."
